model g6_scen_early
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-02
  start 2025-12-30
  end 2026-01-05
  note "T, pre-M1 (#97, chunk 4, P13): the base of scenario topup, which declares a plan over the days kept by a when load can't see (d >= from_day, 31 December), so one instance exists before the scenario's from, 1 January (L §6.4): it books nothing there and is left out at run, with the note; the instances from the from on book"

source s "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input from_day: date

input top_amt: money PLN

input lift_amt: money PLN

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-01-05), top_amt, lift_amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  from_day = 2025-12-31
  top_amt = 1.00 PLN
  lift_amt = 2.00 PLN
  opening[konto] = 10.00 PLN at 2025-12-30 start
